title: "Who makes money on Uniswap V3?"
abstract: >-
  A trade-by-trade study of the Uniswap V3 USDC/WETH 0.05% pool on Ethereum, July to September 2026,
  marked out against Binance: who has edge against the pool, who pays for it, and where the money
  ends up, with pre-registered tests.
